self.KB_CONTENT["card:779611"]={"id":"card:779611","ty":"card","sourceId":"779611","title":"『委工單自動發放作業』中的『選擇儲位』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"工單","keywords":["工單","依據","儲位","發放"],"y":"other","answer":"* 若「選擇發放依據=2.儲位」，「選擇儲位」才可輸入。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:778425"]={"id":"card:778425","ty":"card","sourceId":"778425","title":"『領料單建立作業』中的『生產線別 (TC005)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"領料單","keywords":["領料單","生產","直接","線別"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可按[F2]生產線資料查詢，並直接顯示生產線名稱。此欄位可為空白。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
