self.KB_CONTENT["card:780035"]={"id":"card:780035","ty":"card","sourceId":"780035","title":"『生產入庫單建立作業(IDL)』中的『檢驗狀態 (TG016)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"入庫單","keywords":["入庫單","生產","狀態","檢驗"],"y":"other","answer":"* 此欄位僅作顯示。* 分為0.免檢、1.待驗、2.合格及3.不良四種檢驗狀態。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:783737"]={"id":"card:783737","ty":"card","sourceId":"783737","title":"『資產重估憑證』的作業目的為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"憑證","keywords":["憑證","資產","異動"],"y":"explain","answer":"可將資產重估異動相關資料列印成憑證。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
